{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a brutal medieval battleground where survival is the only option! In this action-packed wave survival game, you'll fight against relentless waves of enemies, each more powerful than the last. But you're not alone\u2014harness unique superpowers to devastate your foes and breed pigs with special abilities to aid you in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Wave-Based Hack-and-Slash Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle endless waves of medieval warriors in fast-paced hack-and-slash action. Each enemy brings unique strengths and abilities that test your timing and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Superpowered Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash devastating magic and superpowers to turn the tide of battle. Master elemental attacks, explosive strikes, and devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/43015b628b783bd64f54963dd98d5dfb.poster.avif?t=1767683112\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/43015b628b783bd64f54963dd98d5dfb.webm?t=1767683112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/43015b628b783bd64f54963dd98d5dfb.mp4?t=1767683112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>Pig Breeding System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise and enhance pigs with special powers to fight alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/d1afe79041eca05f6612aa15019c9e68.poster.avif?t=1767683112\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/d1afe79041eca05f6612aa15019c9e68.webm?t=1767683112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/d1afe79041eca05f6612aa15019c9e68.mp4?t=1767683112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities, improve your stats, and customize your combat strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/d0d53d12e8b7ec56b1409d72a1199029.poster.avif?t=1767683112\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/d0d53d12e8b7ec56b1409d72a1199029.webm?t=1767683112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/d0d53d12e8b7ec56b1409d72a1199029.mp4?t=1767683112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerful Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly difficult foes that evolve with your progress. Adapt, strategize, and survive the brutal wave-based arena combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Survive the Onslaught?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, adapt, and conquer your way to becoming the ultimate medieval warrior!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Just getting started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3313330/712fe6ebd1e86a42ed2a3a752935abfe3eb4a5d0.jpg"},{"name":"Getting the hang of it","path":"htt