"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mild fantasy violence and combat involving medieval weapons and superpowered enemies. There is no excessive gore, but characters may engage in battle using swords, magic, and other abilities. The game also features lighthearted humor and fictional creatures, such as special pigs that aid in combat."},"demos":[{"appid":4118870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a brutal medieval battleground where survival is the only option! In this action-packed wave survival game, you'll fight against relentless waves of enemies, each more powerful than the last. But you're not alone\u2014harness unique superpowers to devastate your foes and breed pigs with special abilities to aid you in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Wave-Based Hack-and-Slash Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle endless waves of medieval warriors in fast-paced hack-and-slash action. Each enemy brings unique strengths and abilities that test your timing and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Superpowered Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash devastating magic and superpowers to turn the tide of battle. Master elemental attacks, explosive strikes, and devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/43015b628b783bd64f54963dd98d5dfb.poster.avif?t=1767683112\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/43015b628b783bd64f54963dd98d5dfb.webm?t=1767683112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/43015b628b783bd64f54963dd98d5d